# Instinct 16x16 vet kit — a cloth-wrapped remedy pouch with a leaf-green cross.
# Soft-cornered linen pouch, ink silhouette outline, warm off-white cloth ramp
# (bone highlight upper-left → ash midtone → smoke shadow lower-right), and a bold
# emerald cross centered on the face. Light from top-left.
size: 16

legend:
  @ ink
  h bone
  l ash
  s smoke
  g emerald
  G emerald-bright
  . transparent

